## 3. Custom Database Enums

### `UploadedFileSourceType`
Defined in [file_model.py](file:///d:/Zenteiq/Tasks/File_Ingestion/server/src/models/file_model.py#L82-L86). Used by `uploaded_files.source_type` and `async_ingestion_jobs.provider`.

| Value | PostgreSQL Enum Name / String | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `FTP` | `"FTP"` | Ingested via local FTP watch directory or external remote FTP pull |
| `Local` | `"Local"` | Direct chunked browser upload |
| `GDrive` | `"GDrive"` | Pulled asynchronously from Google Drive API |
| `Sharepoint` | `"Sharepoint"` | Pulled asynchronously from Microsoft SharePoint / OneDrive Graph API |

