Model source: [file_model.py](file:///d:/Zenteiq/Tasks/File_Ingestion/server/src/models/file_model.py#L127-L145)  
Description: Translation table ("Rosetta Stone") linking provider-native file identifiers and hashes to server master SHA-256 hashes for instant deduplication.

