| `provider_file_id` | `VARCHAR(255)` | No | None | Index | Unique remote provider item ID |
| `provider_hash` | `VARCHAR(255)` | No | None | Index, Unique Composite (`uq_provider_name_hash`) | Remote hash (MD5, QuickXor, etc.) |
| `master_hash` | `VARCHAR(64)` | No | None | Foreign Key -> `uploaded_files.master_hash` (`ON DELETE CASCADE`), Index | Server canonical SHA-256 hash |
